  "notes": "A rap group turned four-on-the-floor EDM-pop act, modelled strictly in the 2009-2011 dance-crossover window — the entry says why the window matters: \"the pre-crossover records instead used a swung hip-hop kit\". Inside it the kit is \"electro-house kick on all four, huge layered clap on 2&4, 16th hats, and white-noise riser builds into the drop\", so the perc lanes are riser/impact and the clap layer is offset wide. The low end is the documented hybrid — \"distorted saw bass in the drop, 808 sub under the rap verses\" — which is why `bass808` is authored as `counter_riff`: giving it the `bassline` role would have deleted the saw bass entirely. The vocal architecture is the other identity: \"rapped and chanted lines traded across four members converging on a unison gang hook\", plus \"heavily vocoded/Auto-Tuned lead lines used as an instrument\", so the melody is a traded call-and-response at high density with a vocoder timbre and the counter answers rather than doubles. Harmony is \"a bed for the chant\", two- or four-chord minor. ⚠ The research marks that harmony `[LOW-CONF]` and calls the drum and bass parameters convention-derived; both marks are repeated here, and every velocity and density above is INFERRED. ⚠ **The countermelody reached 953/1000 distinct answers against a floor of 980 (2026-08-17, counter variety floor).** The 1-bar value came out of `melody.phraseBars`, which is now [2,4] weighted [4,3]. `generators::melody` writes a phrase's rhythm **once** and reuses it for every repeat, so a 1-bar phrase gives the whole clip one bar of rhythmic entropy — and the counter, whose onsets are read off the lead's, inherits that ceiling. Distinctness is combinatorial in the shape LENGTH, not in the option count. ⚠ The value that moved here is INFERRED rather than a researched claim — the entry's Melody/chords line reads \"heavily vocoded/Auto-Tuned lead lines used as an instrument, plus a detuned saw riff; loops are 4 bars. The vocal architecture is rapped and chanted lines traded across four members converging on a unison gang hook.\", and every claim in it still holds after the change.",
